---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Impressum" description="Osnovne informacije o brendu i kontaktu.">
  <div class="legal-page">
    <header class="legal-hero"><div class="legal-wrap"><p class="legal-eyebrow">MODULARNI SISTEMI / PRAVNE INFORMACIJE</p><h1>Impressum</h1><p class="legal-lead">Osnovne informacije o brendu i kontaktu.</p></div></header>
    <div class="legal-wrap legal-content">
      <article class="legal-copy" aria-label="Impressum">

<section><h2>MODULARNI SISTEMI</h2><dl><dt>Naziv brenda</dt><dd>MODULARNI SISTEMI</dd><dt>Internet adresa</dt><dd><a href="https://modularnisistemi.com">https://modularnisistemi.com</a></dd><dt>Email</dt><dd><a href="mailto:kontakt@modularnisistemi.com">kontakt@modularnisistemi.com</a></dd><dt>Telefon</dt><dd><a href="tel:+38166241386">+381 66 241 386</a></dd></dl></section>
<section><h2>O brendu i sajtu</h2><p>MODULARNI SISTEMI je komercijalni brend, a ne zasebno registrovana firma, pravno lice ili preduzetnik. Sajt je informativnog karaktera i predstavlja ponudu brenda.</p><p>Sajtom lično upravlja Vedran Begić, fizičko lice i rukovalac podacima o ličnosti. Za pitanja o podacima pišite na <a href="mailto:kontakt@modularnisistemi.com">kontakt@modularnisistemi.com</a>. Naziv brenda nije poslovno ime registrovanog pravnog subjekta.</p></section>

      </article>
      <nav class="legal-related" aria-label="Povezane pravne stranice"><a href="/privatnost/">Politika privatnosti</a><a href="/uslovi-koriscenja/">Uslovi korišćenja</a><a href="/impressum/">Impressum</a><a href="/kontakt/">Kontakt</a></nav>
    </div>
  </div>
  <style>
  .legal-page{background:#f1f4f6;color:#071e2a;font-family:var(--font-body);min-height:60vh}.legal-wrap{width:min(1040px,calc(100% - 40px));margin-inline:auto}.legal-hero{background:#061b28;color:#fff;padding:56px 0 48px}.legal-eyebrow{color:#ff6900;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.14em;margin:0 0 20px}.legal-hero h1{font-size:clamp(34px,5vw,54px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:0 0 18px;font-weight:800}.legal-lead{max-width:720px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#b5c8d3;margin:0}.legal-content{padding:38px 0 58px}.legal-notice{border:1px solid #dbb69b;border-left:3px solid #ff6900;background:#fff6ed;padding:20px 23px;margin-bottom:28px}.legal-notice h2{font-size:17px;margin:0 0 10px}.legal-notice p{margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.8}.legal-copy{background:#fff;border:1px solid #d8e0e6;padding:10px 32px 25px}.legal-copy section{padding:24px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d8e0e6}.legal-copy section:last-child{border-bottom:0}.legal-copy h2{font-size:20px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:0 0 14px}.legal-copy p,.legal-copy li,.legal-copy dd,.legal-copy dt{font-size:14px;line-height:1.85}.legal-copy p{margin:0 0 12px}.legal-copy p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}.legal-copy ul{list-style:disc;padding-left:22px;margin:12px 0}.legal-copy li+li{margin-top:7px}.legal-page a{color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.legal-page a:hover{color:#d95300}.legal-copy .legal-fill{background:#fff6ed;border-left:3px solid #ff6900;padding:13px 16px;margin-top:15px;font-size:13px}.legal-copy dl{margin:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:190px 1fr;gap:12px 20px}.legal-copy dt{font-weight:800}.legal-copy dd{margin:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.legal-related{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px 24px;padding-top:24px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700}.legal-version{font-size:11px;color:#617783;margin:22px 0 0}@media(max-width:640px){.legal-wrap{width:calc(100% - 32px)}.legal-hero{padding:40px 0 35px}.legal-content{padding:25px 0 40px}.legal-copy{padding:0 20px 15px}.legal-copy section{padding:22px 0}.legal-copy dl{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:3px}.legal-copy dd{margin-bottom:12px}.legal-notice{padding:17px}.legal-copy h2{font-size:18px}}
</style>
</BaseLayout>
